OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:Fthickening
OL,6,Fclod and rain moves form the northwest
OL,7,Fto the southeast overnight. Some heavy
OL,8,Frain affecting western and northern
OL,9,Fareas, especially over the high
OL,10,Fground. Blustery showers then follow
OL,11,Fin the north and northwest later. A
OL,12,Fgenerally mild night.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FRain clears southeastern
OL,15,FEngland by early afternoon. Elsewhere,
OL,16,Fsunny spells and showers. Most
OL,17,Ffrequent in the north with strong
OL,18,Fwinds and coastal gales possible.
OL,19,FFeeling cool in the brisk winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
